03:08:30.320 --> 03:08:59.910
to the line. A whole bunch of cars coming down here side by side. That's Dick Trickle, Rusty Wallace, Ricky Rudd. Rusty Wallace was a lap down. He made that unscheduled pin stop. Davey Allison has pulled off the victory in the Pepsi 400. Pulling the windscreen down so he can say hello to people. Davey, this is Bob Jenkins of ESPN. You got me?

