03:09:24.290 --> 03:09:29.920
you've become the master of these carburetor restrictor plates Robert. Well Davey just gets around

03:09:30.000 --> 03:09:33.800
super speedway tracks and our engine guys and you know just everybody worked

03:09:33.800 --> 03:09:37.280
great hey a real close call and you showed a lot of poise when Davey had to

03:09:37.280 --> 03:09:40.640
come into the pits early on you had that electrical problem you dived one of your

03:09:40.640 --> 03:09:44.720
crew members dived inside the car made the switch you guys never say die well

03:09:45.060 --> 03:09:48.260
I'll tell you that you know after the past few weeks having spark plug wires

03:09:48.260 --> 03:09:52.940
come off and you know a lot of heat just went through my head you know and I

03:09:52.940 --> 03:09:57.710
said dad come we you know we went over everything so carefully and thank

03:09:57.710 --> 03:09:59.970
goodness it worked out it certainly did work out

