and they're on their way to Victory Lane, and we'll be talking to them later.

03:10:02.680 --> 03:10:02.820
Bob?

03:10:03.380 --> 03:10:06.480
Well, this has been a record-setting day for us here at ESPN.

03:10:06.640 --> 03:10:11.220
It's the first time we've ever had an in-car camera carried to Victory Lane.

03:10:11.240 --> 03:10:16.090
It was just a little more than a year ago in February of 1988

03:10:16.090 --> 03:10:21.850
that Davey Allison followed his father, Bobby, to the checkered flag in the Daytona 500.

03:10:22.050 --> 03:10:24.970
Now Davey wins on the same racetrack.

03:10:25.050 --> 03:10:25.630
