David, you're about to start your way back in the middle of the week with about 20 laps to go.

03:11:07.320 --> 03:11:08.160
This must be exciting.

03:11:09.720 --> 03:11:14.700
I'll tell you what, first of all, I've got to do a little bit of a rest of these guys and have to take them out.

03:11:15.300 --> 03:11:16.340
They've done a great job.

03:11:16.480 --> 03:11:17.600
We've done a great job. We've done a lot of work all the way.

03:11:17.800 --> 03:11:20.060
We didn't have a job in Miami for the first week.

03:11:20.060 --> 03:11:21.440
We've done a lot of work hard on it.

03:11:21.680 --> 03:11:23.160
We've done a long time, too, but we've done a lot of work hard on it.

03:11:23.500 --> 03:11:29.980
But here we are, I'll tell you what, I want to say a special thing to me because we've done a lot of work.

03:11:30.120 --> 03:11:31.220
It's been a long time.

03:11:33.090 --> 03:11:35.950
We've been scared, but he's the one that got his own part.

03:11:36.230 --> 03:11:38.610
