The top ten finishers in the Pepsi 400, Davy Allison wins,

03:15:09.900 --> 03:15:13.320
Morgan Shepard second, then Phil Parsons, Bill Elliott, and Alan Kowicki.

03:15:13.850 --> 03:15:18.270
Six through ten, Terry Labonte, Sterling Marlin, Dick Trickle, Ricky Rudd, and Hutt Strickland.

