03:15:32.100 --> 03:15:33.680
and Pepsi, and Davey, congratulations

03:15:33.680 --> 03:15:35.700
on an outstanding run. Thank you, Jerry. You know,

03:15:35.820 --> 03:15:37.980
I've got to say again, all our credit's got to go to

