the whole Texaco, Havilland,

03:15:39.860 --> 03:15:42.100
Thunderbird crew here, Robert Yates and all the gang,

03:15:42.200 --> 03:15:44.040
but I just told Dick Brooks on the radio

03:15:44.040 --> 03:15:45.980
we owe a special thanks on this

03:15:45.980 --> 03:15:47.860
race to a guy that got us all started here

03:15:47.860 --> 03:15:50.020
and near. We know you're out there watching, and this

03:15:50.020 --> 03:15:52.140
one's for you, pal. Thanks. We appreciate

03:15:52.140 --> 03:15:53.900
it. You know, many firsts today.

03:15:54.440 --> 03:15:56.160
It's the first time we at ESPN have ever

03:15:56.160 --> 03:15:58.120
had an in-car camera go to Victory Lane. Thank you

03:15:58.120 --> 03:15:59.220
for us. Well,

03:16:00.000 --> 03:16:00.920
You know, it's a great feeling.

03:16:01.040 --> 03:16:04.040
We've carried in-car camera to second place, but never to Victory Lane.

03:16:04.220 --> 03:16:06.180
And today we got it right here in Victory Lane.

03:16:06.280 --> 03:16:07.760
You know, I hate to see Mark have problems.

03:16:07.860 --> 03:16:10.380
He was awful strong out there, and Bill was strong too.

03:16:10.480 --> 03:16:13.840
But I was able to get this Texaco Haviland Thunderbird up into position,

03:16:13.940 --> 03:16:17.140
and when Mark had problems right there at the end, I was able to take advantage of it.

03:16:17.240 --> 03:16:19.380
But, again, all these guys have done a great job.

03:16:19.460 --> 03:16:20.680
We didn't start off that good.

03:16:21.000 --> 03:16:21.940
We had a few problems.

03:16:21.940 --> 03:16:25.320
We got behind, but this thing is so strong, it just caught right back up.

03:16:25.916 --> 03:16:27.736
Those last few laps, you had to be a little bit concerned.

03:16:27.876 --> 03:16:29.996
Watching Morgan Shepard, did he surprise you with his strength?

03:16:30.000 --> 03:16:34.480
the three or four laps to go? No, I watched him in practice and I knew he was strong at Talladega so

03:16:34.480 --> 03:16:37.920
I kept my eye on him. I knew he was going to be trying something. I just wanted to make sure I was

03:16:37.920 --> 03:16:38.960
where he wanted to be.

03:16:39.532 --> 03:16:41.652
Davey Allison is smiling, and so does Dad Bobby.

03:16:41.712 --> 03:16:42.552
He's got to be real happy.

03:16:42.692 --> 03:16:44.672
Yeah, this is the second race that he's seen us win.

03:16:44.872 --> 03:16:47.332
He's up in the Buick sweep and watching today.

03:16:47.412 --> 03:16:48.572
Had his fingers crossed for us.

03:16:48.632 --> 03:16:51.212
I know the Buick people didn't want to see a Ford win today,

03:16:51.292 --> 03:16:53.492
but I think he had a little prejudice there.

03:16:53.744 --> 03:16:54.804
I'm sure he did.

03:16:54.904 --> 03:16:58.824
And young son, Davey Allison, goes to victory lane and winning the Pepsi 400.

03:16:59.500 --> 03:17:00.000
At our...

03:17:00.000 --> 03:17:06.960
Congratulations to Davey Allison and to all of those who provided some excellent competition for us this afternoon.

03:17:06.960 --> 03:17:16.140
Now, when they came down for the checkered flag, we of course watched Davey Allison finish first and Morgan Shepard finish second, but the real battle was for third place.

03:17:16.604 --> 03:17:22.384
And it was Phil Parsons on the inside of Bill Elliott and without the help of another car to draft by.

03:17:22.844 --> 03:17:24.084
He gets the position.

03:17:24.404 --> 03:17:25.164
Position number three.

03:17:25.284 --> 03:17:26.724
Phil ran a super race here today.

03:17:26.764 --> 03:17:28.984
Young Phil does do very well at this track.

03:17:28.984 --> 03:17:29.984
And this was a...

03:17:30.604 --> 03:17:32.764
real great performance. Daytona and Talladega

03:17:32.764 --> 03:17:34.764
Phil's car is extremely strong. He told me

03:17:34.764 --> 03:17:36.784
before he came to Daytona that he felt

03:17:36.784 --> 03:17:38.404
like he had a car that could win the race.

03:17:39.116 --> 03:17:43.216
It's been an exciting afternoon of competition for us here at Daytona.

03:17:43.276 --> 03:17:45.416
We hope you enjoyed it as much as we did.

03:17:45.856 --> 03:17:51.336
