Tomorrow morning, it's the Camel Continental

03:18:04.040 --> 03:18:06.040
IMSA race from Watkins Glen, New York.

03:18:06.100 --> 03:18:07.880
And at 3 o'clock tomorrow afternoon,

03:18:08.284 --> 03:18:12.524
Same-day coverage of the IndyCar race from, again, Cleveland, Ohio.

03:18:13.084 --> 03:18:16.924
Once again, Davey Allison has won the Pepsi 400.

03:18:17.372 --> 03:18:21.772
here at Daytona International Speedway in a great, great race.

03:18:21.872 --> 03:18:24.052
Thank you for joining us for Benny Parsons.

